### VARIABLES


@HOST = http://localhost:
@PORT = 8080
@SERVER = {{HOST}}{{PORT}}

### STEP 1: UPLOAD AN IMAGE (use imageId from response)

POST {{SERVER}}/api/images/upload
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary

------WebKitFormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="diseased-plant.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< /Users/tebohonyombolo/Downloads/Yellow-leaf-spot-late-infection-on-mature-plants-.webp
------WebKitFormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="description"

Plant with suspected disease for diagnosis
------WebKitFormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="userId"

1
------WebKitFormBoundary--


### STEP 2: RUN DIAGNOSIS (update imageId from upload response)


### Full Context Diagnosis
POST {{SERVER}}/api/diagnoses/analyze
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "imageId": 17,
  "trackerId": 1,
  "cropId": 1,
  "cropName": "Plant",
  "plantAge": "2 weeks old, vegetative stage",
  "symptoms": "Yellow spots on lower leaves, some leaf curling, stunted growth",
  "weatherConditions": "Hot and humid, recent heavy rains",
  "locationRegion": "Johannesburg, South Africa"
}

###

### Minimal Diagnosis (image + crop name only)
POST {{SERVER}}/api/diagnoses/analyze
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "imageId": 1,
  "cropName": "Tomato"
}

###

### Image Only Diagnosis (no context)
POST {{SERVER}}/api/diagnoses/analyze
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "imageId": 1
}

###

### Diagnosis for CropTracker (pest observation)
POST {{SERVER}}/api/diagnoses/analyze
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "imageId": 1,
  "trackerId": 1,
  "cropName": "Maize",
  "plantAge": "6 weeks old, flowering stage",
  "symptoms": "Brown lesions on leaves, powdery mildew on stems",
  "weatherConditions": "Warm, dry spell followed by rain",
  "locationRegion": "Johannesburg, South Africa"
}

### ============================================
### STEP 3: GET DIAGNOSIS RESULTS
### ============================================

### Get Diagnosis by ID
GET {{SERVER}}/api/diagnoses/1

###

### Get Diagnosis by Image ID
GET {{SERVER}}/api/diagnoses/image/1

###

### Get Diagnoses by CropTracker
GET {{SERVER}}/api/diagnoses/tracker/1

###

### Get Diagnoses by Crop
GET {{SERVER}}/api/diagnoses/crop/1

###

### Get All Diagnoses
GET {{SERVER}}/api/diagnoses

### ============================================
### DELETE DIAGNOSIS
### ============================================

### Delete Diagnosis
DELETE {{SERVER}}/api/diagnoses/1

